    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47073" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sur-rŭbĕo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subr-</span></b> ), ēre,
			v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to be somewhat red</i> or <i>reddish</i>, <i>to blush</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quale coloratum Tithoni conjuge caelum
					Subrubet, aut sponso visa puella novo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 2, 5, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uva purpureo mero,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					A. 2, 316</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">grossi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Mart. 10, 31</span></i>
			.</div>
